{"_doc":"Per letter id (order P, I…VIII, E): words = up to 8 lemma keys of lexicon_ko.json for the \"today's words\" card, chosen from that letter's Korean line by chapter band (P/I–II: A1–A2, III–V: B1, VI–VIII/E: B2–C1; widened by one band only when needed), never repeating a lemma of an earlier letter; nouns, verbs, adjectives, adverbs only — no names, function words, homograph entries (one-syllable words are allowed). spots = [] (plate spots keep their words for this language). phrases = 1–2 expressions copied verbatim from the Korean line: {t: text, m: message index, ko, en, note_ko, note_en} — en = English translation, ko = plain-Korean paraphrase.","lang":"ko","letters":{"p1":{"words":["하느님","다음","바로","아빠","어리다","때","지금"],"spots":[],"phrases":[{"t":"지금도 변함없어요","m":0,"ko":"지금도 그대로예요","en":"it's still the same now","note_ko":"변함없다: 바뀌지 않다. -어요: 높임 말투.","note_en":"변함없다 = unchanged; -어요 is polite speech."}]},"p2":{"words":["사람","말","전","오다","기억나다"],"spots":[],"phrases":[{"t":"사람들 말로는","m":0,"ko":"남들이 하는 말로는","en":"according to what people say","note_ko":"-로는: 근거 ('~에 따르면').","note_en":"-로는 = according to."}]},"p3":{"words":["모르다","전부"],"spots":[],"phrases":[{"t":"어떤 때는 전부였다가","m":0,"ko":"한때는 모든 것이었다가","en":"at one time I'm everything","note_ko":"-었다가: 상태가 바뀜.","note_en":"-었다가 = was …, then (it changes)."}]},"c1-l1":{"words":["누나","편지","쓰다","생기다","노래","잘하다","부르다","목소리"],"spots":[],"phrases":[{"t":"즐거웠다니 진심으로 기뻐","m":0,"ko":"재미있었다니 정말 기뻐","en":"I'm truly glad you enjoyed it","note_ko":"-다니: 들은 사실에 대한 감정.","note_en":"-다니 reacts to news one has heard."},{"t":"쓰기 바로 전에","m":1,"ko":"쓰기 직전에","en":"just before writing","note_ko":"-기 전에: '~하기 전에'.","note_en":"-기 전에 = before doing."}]},"c1-l2":{"words":["엄마","보내다","도시","마음","들다","성","침대","발"],"spots":[],"phrases":[{"t":"하느님 덕분에","m":0,"ko":"다행히","en":"thank God","note_ko":"덕분에: 고마운 원인.","note_en":"덕분에 = thanks to."},{"t":"통 쉬지 못한다는 거","m":2,"ko":"전혀 쉬지 못하는 것","en":"that I can't rest at all","note_ko":"통 + 부정: 전혀.","note_en